Current meds (please confirm/correct): lisinopril 20 mg daily, atorvastatin 40 mg daily, omeprazole 20 mg daily (is this correct?), [any others?]. Recent A1C/glucose: [please confirm]. Last PCP: Dr. Amy Foster, Denver Heart Institute.

Thanks — would you like me to schedule anything or order tests before the appointment?

Best,
